{"4086770": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Last Shift", "steam_appid": 4086770, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You inherit an old shop and come to inspect it. Once inside, the doors lock, and the store begins to change. Corridors shift, rooms distort, and exits disappear. Something unseen is working against you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your goal is to survive, understand what is happening, and find a way out. The store itself feels hostile, reacting to your presence and preventing escape by any means necessary.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Psychological Horror</strong><br>A tense, oppressive atmosphere built on fear of the unknown.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Living Environment</strong><br>The store constantly changes its layout, creating confusion and disorientation.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unseen Threat</strong><br>A dangerous presence stalks the store, punishing mistakes and careless movement.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Survival-Focused Gameplay</strong><br>No combat — only evasion, hiding, and quick decision-making.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Environmental Storytelling</strong><br>Piece together the store’s dark past through subtle clues and details.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The store doesn’t want you to leave.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You inherit an old shop and come to inspect it. Once inside, the doors lock, and the store begins to change. Corridors shift, rooms distort, and exits disappear. Something unseen is working against you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your goal is to survive, understand what is happening, and find a way out. The store itself feels hostile, reacting to your presence and preventing escape by any means necessary.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Psychological Horror</strong><br>A tense, oppressive atmosphere built on fear of the unknown.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Living Environment</strong><br>The store constantly changes its layout, creating confusion and disorientation.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unseen Threat</strong><br>A dangerous presence stalks the store, punishing mistakes and careless movement.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Survival-Focused Gameplay</strong><br>No combat — only evasion, hiding, and quick decision-making.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Environmental Storytelling</strong><br>Piece together the store’s dark past through subtle clues and details.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The store doesn’t want you to leave.</p>", "short_description": "Last Shift is a first-person survival horror game with no combat. Explore an abandoned grocery store, flee from a sinister creature, find hidden items, and solve unsettling puzzles. Overcome your fear to uncover the terrifying truth behind the store’s abandonment.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4086770/252308994c2b6d7fa6743131131d7adc2baf7dde/header.jpg?t=1765958588", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4086770/1f6cce4f66522b6213696a1abf24645e780e2515/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1765958588", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4086770/1f6cce4f66522b6213696a1abf24645e780e2515/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1765958588", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 (64-bit)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-660